    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "#Values Explorer Idea Chatbot\r\n\r\nUse this bot to brainstorm and refine your project's theme, value, and dataset idea. It can help you think through what your app should focus on, why that value matters, and what kinds of items belong in your dataset.\r\n\r\n:::details [<i class=\"fa fa-briefcase\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Need a starting prompt?**]\r\n>I have a few ideas for what my Value Explorer could focus on, but I’m not sure which one would be most meaningful. Can you help me think it through?\r\n\r\n>I’m thinking about exploring the value of [access/time/cost/safety/etc.]. What kinds of data items might fit that theme?\r\n\r\n>I’m not sure which perspectives or communities I should consider when defining my dataset. Can you help me brainstorm?\r\n:::\r\n",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
